      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyichi Ashuru, ka Sargoni jed'ani, qonqo gara namicha gudda duula Ashuruti erge waan jed'eeni, Beeni, dira Filisti ka Ashdodi jed'ani had'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna sadi ka dabre AABBO Waaqi waan Isaya ilma Amozitini jed'e, Kobe tante baafad'i, ch'arqi naqatu tanale yaafad'u. Inni ee jed'e kobeefi woya yaafate qullaa qunquma deeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira Ashdodi kaani qabani jennaani AABBO Waaqi waan jed'e. Hojattuuni tiyya Isayaani haga ganna sadi kobeefi woya male qulla qunquma deema. Tunini akheekha waan lafti Misiritiifi ta Kushi iti deemtu garsiisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyuuni Ashuru nama inni lafa lamaani suni keesaa boojie ch'ufa qulla boojie itiini d'aabata. Worri sunini, diqaafi guddaleeni, kobeefi woya male qulla yae huddu ufi mullise akasiini worra Misiri ch'eersa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama Kushi abdate worra Misiri heregate, ch'eersani balleesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya suni nami Filisti ka afaani Baariini tau waan jed'u, Me, worra nu abdane waan worri hayyu Ashuru nura d'owu seene waan inni tahe ilaala! Duuba amma nu kara kamiini duraa baana re?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daayya aka diri Babiloni baddu garsiiftu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
